{"seq":1,"slug":"zero-extreme-price-detect","title":"0元/极端异常价识别","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-price-compliance-patrol/abnormal-price-detect/zero-extreme-price-detect","wordCount":3235,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"0元-极端异常价识别\">0元/极端异常价识别</h1><p>凌晨三点，一个卖家把 2000 件商品的标价批量改成了 <code>0.00</code>，因为他准备把价格表在 06:00 换成正确的——只要这三小时里没人下单。这类事故在平台侧的真实形态不是「价格错了」，而是<strong>价格错了几小时而系统没有任何人知道</strong>。价格合规巡检的第一层能力因此极其朴素：在商品页面对外可见之前，在同一个事务边界内，把不可能的价格挡住；挡不住时，在分钟级内发现并冻结。它不追求统计优雅，追求的是<strong>漏检代价与误伤代价之间的确定性取舍</strong>。</p>\n<p>本文只处理「价格这个数字本身是否离谱」——零价、负价、数量级错误、币种单位错误的标价。价格随时间的分布型异常（稳健离群、抬价再降）属于 <a href=\"price-distribution-outlier\">基于分布的离群价巡检</a>，跨币种换算引入的异常属于 <a href=\"currency-conversion-anomaly\">多币种换算与汇率异常</a>，发现之后的冻结与下架动作属于 <a href=\"../patrol-task-enforce/price-freeze-delist-action\">价格冻结/下架处置</a>。本文的边界是：<strong>给定一条商品报价记录，在不需要任何历史上下文的前提下判定它是否可能是一起价格事故。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>价格写错之所以是平台级风险而非商家级风险，是因为三类外部约束同时落在平台上。第一类是消费者保护层面的<strong>诱饵定价</strong>（bait-and-switch）——用不真实的低价吸引点击再引导到别的商品，Google 的购物政策把它列为「egregious violation」，一经发现直接暂停账号且不预先警告（<a href=\"https://support.google.com/merchants/answer/6150127\">Google Merchant Center, Misrepresentation</a>）。第二类是 FTC 关于「Unfair or Deceptive Fees」的规则，它对披露总价与费用构成提出要求，<code>0.00</code> 展示价一旦成交即构成全部费用的虚假陈述（<a href=\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/cfr/text/16/464.1\">16 CFR Part 464</a>）。第三类是交易层面的直接损失：购物车与结算链路在没有价格下限校验时会正常走完，一笔 0 元订单的成本是全额履约成本。</p>\n<p>系统的目标因而可以精确表述为：对每一条进入「可售状态」的报价，计算一个布尔判定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext>block</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>flag</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>pass</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D(p) \\in \\{\\text{block}, \\text{flag}, \\text{pass}\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">block</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">flag</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pass</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>，并把处置动作挂到判定结果上。判定的输入只有报价记录本身（标价、币种、数量单位、成本参考、品类），不依赖历史。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[报价写入事件] --&gt; B{标价 &lt;= 0?}&#10;  B --&gt;|是| C[BLOCK 硬拦截&lt;br/&gt;拒绝进入可售状态]&#10;  B --&gt;|否| D{成本锚可用?}&#10;  D --&gt;|是| E{标价 &lt; 成本 x 下限系数?}&#10;  D --&gt;|否| F[跳过成本护栏]&#10;  E --&gt;|是| C&#10;  E --&gt;|否| G{品类分位区间内?}&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt;|否| H[FLAG 生成巡检任务]&#10;  G --&gt;|是| I[PASS 放行]&#10;  C --&gt; J[记录判定依据 + 通知卖家]&#10;  H --&gt; K[进入巡检批次]\">flowchart TD\n  A[报价写入事件] --&gt; B{标价 &lt;= 0?}\n  B --&gt;|是| C[BLOCK 硬拦截&lt;br/&gt;拒绝进入可售状态]\n  B --&gt;|否| D{成本锚可用?}\n  D --&gt;|是| E{标价 &lt; 成本 x 下限系数?}\n  D --&gt;|否| F[跳过成本护栏]\n  E --&gt;|是| C\n  E --&gt;|否| G{品类分位区间内?}\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt;|否| H[FLAG 生成巡检任务]\n  G --&gt;|是| I[PASS 放行]\n  C --&gt; J[记录判定依据 + 通知卖家]\n  H --&gt; K[进入巡检批次]</pre><p>三种判定的语义差异决定了它们不能混用。<code>BLOCK</code> 是同步路径上的写拒绝，只允许由<strong>无需上下文即可证明错误</strong>的条件触发（价格为负、为零、为 NaN、币种不在 ISO 4217 名单内）；<code>FLAG</code> 是异步路径上的巡检任务，允许误报，因为它只消耗审核产能；<code>PASS</code> 是沉默。把软性判据放进同步路径是这类系统最常见的设计错误——它会以放行延迟的形式惩罚所有卖家，而收益只是省下一次巡检。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>判定</th>\n<th>触发条件性质</th>\n<th>执行位置</th>\n<th>误报代价</th>\n<th>漏检代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>BLOCK</td>\n<td>定义性错误，无需上下文</td>\n<td>写入事务内</td>\n<td>卖家投诉、需申诉通道</td>\n<td>0 元订单与监管处罚</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FLAG</td>\n<td>概率性异常，需要上下文</td>\n<td>异步批处理</td>\n<td>审核产能</td>\n<td>延迟发现（分钟到小时）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PASS</td>\n<td>落在正常区间</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"为什么硬拦截必须留在事务内\">为什么硬拦截必须留在事务内</h3><p>如果零价拦截放在异步巡检里，那么从写入到冻结之间存在的窗口就是损失窗口。这个窗口的长度等于巡检周期加上处置时延，在分钟级；而一次批量改价事故可以在秒级产生数千笔 0 元订单。因此 <code>BLOCK</code> 必须是写路径上的一次同步校验，与报价写入共享同一个事务——要么价格与状态同时落库，要么都不落。这与 <a href=\"../patrol-task-enforce/price-freeze-delist-action\">价格冻结/下架处置</a> 中的异步冻结并不矛盾：同步拦截负责概率上最可能造成直接损失的一类，异步处置负责需要证据链的一类，两者共用同一套判定依据的记录格式，以便申诉时能回答「为什么被拦」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"零价与负价的判定边界\">零价与负价的判定边界</h2><h3 id=\"零价并非总是错误\">零价并非总是错误</h3><p>把 <code>price = 0</code> 一律拦截会误伤三类合法场景，它们必须在写入前就被区分出来，而不是靠事后申诉。第一类是<strong>赠品与 0 元加购</strong>，其价格为零但数量单位绑定主商品，且不存在独立库存；第二类是<strong>免费样品与试用装</strong>，有独立库存但被标注为非卖品状态；第三类是<strong>价格待定的占位记录</strong>，即商品已建档但尚未定价，此时它不应处于「可售」状态。工程上的正确做法不是放宽零价判据，而是<strong>把「可售状态」与「价格已定」解耦</strong>——只有进入 <code>active</code> 状态且标记 <code>price_finalized = true</code> 的记录才参加价格护栏。这样一个 <code>price = 0</code> 的 draft 记录既不触发拦截也不暴露给消费者，判定逻辑无需为赠品写例外。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>价格</th>\n<th>可售状态</th>\n<th>是否过护栏</th>\n<th>建模要点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>赠品/0 元加购</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>豁免</td>\n<td>绑定主商品 ID，不占独立履约单元</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>免费样品</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>豁免</td>\n<td>库存独立，标记 <code>sample</code> 类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>未定价草稿</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>不适用</td>\n<td><code>price_finalized = false</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>误改价事故</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>BLOCK</td>\n<td>无豁免标记，直接拒绝</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>清仓 1 分价</td>\n<td>0.01</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>视成本锚</td>\n<td>可能 FLAG</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"负价与超低价\">负价与超低价</h3><p>负价格在电商语义里几乎总是系统缺陷而非业务意图：它出现在「折扣金额被当作价格写入」的字段错位、退款冲正被误写成报价、以及货币最小单位换算（minor unit 到 major unit）方向写反的场景。判定上把它们合并处理是安全的，因为负价在消费者侧的唯一效果是「平台欠钱」，不存在合法形态。真正需要判据的是<strong>正但极小的价格</strong>：0.01、0.1 这类值可能来自最小单位换算的截断（例如 KRW 无小数位而代码按两位小数处理），也可能来自真实的清仓。区分方法是看<strong>单位一致性</strong>——若同一 SKU 的历史标价与当前标价之比超过数量级阈值且新价格恰好是某个 10 的整数次幂分之一，则高度指向单位错误；若新价格落在品类清仓分布内且成本锚存在，则是业务行为。</p>\n<h2 id=\"极端价的数量级护栏\">极端价的数量级护栏</h2><h3 id=\"基于成本锚的上下界\">基于成本锚的上下界</h3><p>有成本数据的报价可以直接用成本建立护栏。设单位成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>（含采购与到仓成本），允许的最低标价为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\min} = \\alpha c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>，最高标价为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>β</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\max} = \\beta c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 按品类配置。对大多数实物品类，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha = 1.0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.0</span></span></span></span></span> 意味着「低于成本出售」需要显式豁免（例如平台补贴活动），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 的取值需要参照品类的正常加价率。成本锚的价值在于它<strong>不依赖历史价格</strong>，因此对首次上架的商品同样有效；它的局限同样明显——成本数据的覆盖率在长尾卖家上通常远低于标价覆盖率，且成本本身可能过期。因此成本护栏应当作为 FLAG 判据而非 BLOCK 判据，并在成本数据缺失时静默跳过而不是取一个默认值。</p>\n<h3 id=\"基于品类分位数的软护栏\">基于品类分位数的软护栏</h3><p>没有成本锚时，用品类内价格分布做软护栏。设某品类在最近窗口内的标价中位数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span>、中位绝对偏差为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{MAD}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">MAD</span></span></span></span></span></span>，稳健的上下界可取</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>m</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mn>1.4826</mn><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mn>1.4826</mn><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mrow><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[\\, m - k \\cdot 1.4826\\,\\mathrm{MAD},\\;\\; m + k \\cdot 1.4826\\,\\mathrm{MAD} \\,]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.4826</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">MAD</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.4826</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">MAD</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中常数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.4826</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.4826</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.4826</span></span></span></span></span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{MAD}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">MAD</span></span></span></span></span></span> 在正态假设下与标准差一致（<a href=\"https://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/eda/section3/eda356.htm\">NIST/SEMATECH e-Handbook, Measures of Scale</a>），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 取 3 到 5。选用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{MAD}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">MAD</span></span></span></span></span></span> 而非标准差的理由是价格分布具有长右尾，标准差本身被离群值污染，用它构造的区间会把真正需要发现的异常包含进去。这条护栏只产出 FLAG，因为它天然会误伤新品类的首发价、限量品与收藏品。分位区间的构造与更严格的离群检验（Grubbs、广义 ESD）见 <a href=\"price-distribution-outlier\">基于分布的离群价巡检</a>，本文只把它当作一个可插拔的软判据。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 品类-币种价格基线（每个巡检周期重算一次）&#10;CREATE TABLE price_baseline (&#10;  category_id   bigint      NOT NULL,&#10;  currency      char(3)     NOT NULL,&#10;  window_start  timestamptz NOT NULL,&#10;  window_end    timestamptz NOT NULL,&#10;  sample_count  integer     NOT NULL,&#10;  median_price  numeric(20,6) NOT NULL,&#10;  mad_price     numeric(20,6) NOT NULL,&#10;  p01           numeric(20,6) NOT NULL,&#10;  p99           numeric(20,6) NOT NULL,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (category_id, currency, window_start)&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 中位数与 MAD 用 percentile_cont 一次算出（MAD 需两遍：先中位数再绝对偏差中位数）&#10;WITH base AS (&#10;  SELECT category_id, currency,&#10;         percentile_cont(0.5) WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY price) AS med&#10;  FROM offer_snapshot&#10;  WHERE snapped_at &gt;= now() - interval &#39;30 days&#39;&#10;  GROUP BY category_id, currency&#10;)&#10;SELECT b.category_id, b.currency, b.med,&#10;       percentile_cont(0.5) WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY abs(o.price - b.med)) AS mad&#10;FROM base b JOIN offer_snapshot o USING (category_id, currency)&#10;GROUP BY b.category_id, b.currency, b.med;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 品类-币种价格基线（每个巡检周期重算一次）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> price_baseline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  category_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currency      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">char</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  window_start  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  window_end    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sample_count  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">integer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  median_price  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  mad_price     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  p01           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  p99           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (category_id, currency, window_start)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 中位数与 MAD 用 percentile_cont 一次算出（MAD 需两遍：先中位数再绝对偏差中位数）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> base </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> category_id, currency,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         percentile_cont</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITHIN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> GROUP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> price) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> med</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> offer_snapshot</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> snapped_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'30 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> category_id, currency</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">category_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">currency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">med</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       percentile_cont</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITHIN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> GROUP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> abs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">price</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">med</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mad</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> base b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> offer_snapshot o </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (category_id, currency)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">category_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">currency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">med</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>价格列一律用精确数值类型而非浮点。PostgreSQL 的 <code>numeric</code> 支持小数点前最多 131072 位、小数点后最多 16383 位，而 <code>double precision</code> 只有约 15 位十进制有效数字且是<strong>不精确</strong>的（<a href=\"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/datatype-numeric.html\">PostgreSQL, Numeric Types</a>）。把 0.1 这样的值放进浮点再比较相等性，是「价格为 0」这类误判的一个稳定来源。</p>\n<h3 id=\"数量级护栏与单位一致性\">数量级护栏与单位一致性</h3><p>除了与品类比较，还要检查价格自身的数量级结构。对同一 SKU 的连续两次报价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(p_{t-1}, p_t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>10</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log_{10}(p_t / p_{t-1})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是接近整数的值且绝对值大于等于 2，则新价格大概率是单位或小数点错误（1.99 → 199、19.9 → 0.199）。这条判据不依赖品类分布，只需要一条历史记录，因此在发布前同步校验里也能运行；随意性代价是它对真实的大幅调价误报，因此同样归入 FLAG，并在任务里附上「是否为单位错误」的假设供审核人快速确认。</p>\n<h2 id=\"检测规则与分级\">检测规则与分级</h2><h3 id=\"规则表达与优先级\">规则表达与优先级</h3><p>把上述判据写成可配置规则而不是散落的 <code>if</code>，是让这套系统能被治理的前提——规则要有 ID、版本、生效市场与严重度，才能在申诉时回答「依据哪一版规则」。规则求值顺序按「定义性优先」排列：币种合法性 → 价格为有限数 → 价格为正 → 成本下界 → 品类区间 → 数量级跳变。前四条命中即 BLOCK 并终止求值，后三条累积到 FLAG 列表。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;rule_set&quot;: &quot;price_sanity&quot;,&#10;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2026.09&quot;,&#10;  &quot;market&quot;: &quot;DE&quot;,&#10;  &quot;currency&quot;: &quot;EUR&quot;,&#10;  &quot;rules&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;id&quot;: &quot;PS-001&quot;, &quot;when&quot;: &quot;price IS NULL OR NOT isfinite(price)&quot;, &quot;action&quot;: &quot;BLOCK&quot;, &quot;severity&quot;: &quot;critical&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;id&quot;: &quot;PS-002&quot;, &quot;when&quot;: &quot;price &lt;= 0 AND NOT exempt(tags)&quot;, &quot;action&quot;: &quot;BLOCK&quot;, &quot;severity&quot;: &quot;critical&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;id&quot;: &quot;PS-003&quot;, &quot;when&quot;: &quot;currency NOT IN iso4217_list&quot;, &quot;action&quot;: &quot;BLOCK&quot;, &quot;severity&quot;: &quot;critical&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;id&quot;: &quot;PS-010&quot;, &quot;when&quot;: &quot;cost_anchor AND price &lt; cost * low_factor&quot;, &quot;action&quot;: &quot;FLAG&quot;, &quot;severity&quot;: &quot;high&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;id&quot;: &quot;PS-011&quot;, &quot;when&quot;: &quot;price NOT BETWEEN p01 AND p99&quot;, &quot;action&quot;: &quot;FLAG&quot;, &quot;severity&quot;: &quot;medium&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;id&quot;: &quot;PS-012&quot;, &quot;when&quot;: &quot;abs(log10(price / prev_price)) &gt;= 2&quot;, &quot;action&quot;: &quot;FLAG&quot;, &quot;severity&quot;: &quot;high&quot; }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rule_set\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"price_sanity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026.09\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"market\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"currency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EUR\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rules\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E